#: anotherv_sketchtools_lite/ops_knife.py:84
msgid "Cut every face the shape passes through, front and back. Turned on automatically when the viewport is in X-Ray (Alt+Z)"
msgstr "切割形状穿过的每个面，包括正面和背面。当视图处于 X 射线时自动开启（Alt+Z）"

