#: anotherv_sketchtools_lite/ui.py:30
msgid "Half-thickness of the temporary cutter. Bigger = cuts faces further from the picked plane, including curved surfaces"
msgstr "临时切割器的半厚度。越大 = 切割离所选平面更远的面，包括曲面"

