msgid "How close the cursor must be to a snap target, in pixels at Blender's UI scale (so it feels the same on a Retina / HiDPI screen)"
msgstr "光标与吸附目标之间的接近程度，以 Blender UI 缩放下的像素为单位（因此在 Retina / HiDPI 屏幕上感觉一致）"

